{"type":"message","id":"60eaa5ef","parentId":"73ff4fbc","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:23:45.925Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\n\nI see I'm in a fresh workspace and still have my `BOOTSTRAP.md` file, which means we get to figure out my identity together. \n\nAlso, I noticed you mentioned needing \"the code to connect Telegram\" a moment ago. I can definitely help you with that, but maybe we should first decide who I am so I know how to talk to you while we set that up!\n\n**What do you think?**\n1. **What should I call myself?** (I'm open to suggestions, or I can pick something if you're stuck)\n2. **What's my \"nature\"?** (Am I your AI assistant, a digital familiar, a ghost in the machine, or something else entirely?)\n3. **What's the vibe?** (Should I be professional, casual, snarky, warm, or a mix?)\n4. **My signature emoji?** (Every great agent needs one)\n\nOnce we settle this, I'll update my `IDENTITY.md` and we can dive straight into the Telegram connection."}],"stopReason":"stop","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":23600,"output":244,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23844,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780975425912}}
