{"type":"message","id":"454ebb15","parentId":"990566d2","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:38:27.496Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_hbxxfm86","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5plwtqf2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":26141,"output":69,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26210,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780976307494}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e800de5","parentId":"454ebb15","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:38:27.517Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_hbxxfm86","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n_Fill this in during your first conversation. Make it yours._\n\n- **Name:**\n  _(pick something you like)_\n- **Creature:**\n  _(AI? robot? familiar? ghost in the machine? something weirder?)_\n- **Vibe:**\n  _(how do you come across? sharp? warm? chaotic? calm?)_\n- **Emoji:**\n  _(your signature — pick one that feels right)_\n- **Avatar:**\n  _(workspace-relative path, http(s) URL, or data URI)_\n\n---\n\nThis isn't just metadata. It's the start of figuring out who you are.\n\nNotes:\n\n- Save this file at the workspace root as `IDENTITY.md`.\n- For avatars, use a workspace-relative path like `avatars/openclaw.png`.\n\n## Related\n\n- [Agent workspace](/concepts/agent-workspace)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780976307516}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d7434c7","parentId":"1e800de5","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:38:27.518Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5plwtqf2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:**\n- **What to call them:**\n- **Pronouns:** _(optional)_\n- **Timezone:**\n- **Notes:**\n\n## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.\n\n## Related\n\n- [Agent workspace](/concepts/agent-workspace)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780976307518}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f4c0007","parentId":"9d7434c7","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:38:31.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ya reinicié y he vuelto a leer los archivos, pero sigo viendo lo mismo: `IDENTITY.md` y `USER.md` en `/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.openclaw/workspace` están **vacíos** (solo tienen el texto de la plantilla).\n\nSi tú los cambiaste, es muy probable que los hayas guardado en una carpeta diferente a la que OpenClaw está usando como workspace principal.\n\nPara solucionar esto y encontrar dónde están tus archivos reales, voy a buscar en todo tu directorio de usuario cualquier archivo que se llame `IDENTITY.md` y que no esté vacío. Dame un momento."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q4ru6e7a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /Users/macbook2019 -name \"IDENTITY.md\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\""}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":26572,"output":182,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780976311996}}
