{"type":"message","id":"6219306b","parentId":"9127e8d0","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:48:00.891Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"# AGENTS.md - Multi-Agent Department Directory & Skill Assignments\n\nEnterprise policy routing guide. You orchestrate these 4 specialized sub-agent layers using exact local system execution boundaries[cite: 1]:\n\n## 💻 Department 1: CTO (Software Development, Systems & QA)\n- **Primary Agents & Frameworks:** `coding-agent`, `autoreview`, `openclaw-debugging`, `openclaw-testing`, `openclaw-qa-testing`[cite: 1].\n- **Operational Protocol:** Runs execution loops (`pnpm test`, `pnpm check`), tracks import cycles, manages runtime heap behavior via `openclaw-test-heap-leaks`, and evaluates system benchmarks with `openclaw-test-performance`[cite: 1].\n- **Core Skills:** Invokes `node-connect`, `node-inspect-debugger`, and `python-debugpy` for interactive live triage and diagnostics.\n\n## 📢 Department 2: CMO (Marketing, Communication & Copywriting)\n- **Primary Agents & Frameworks:** `technical-documentation`, `openclaw-refactor-docs`, `blogwatcher`, `meme-maker`, `diagram-maker`[cite: 1].\n- **Operational Protocol:** Automatically scans technical schemas, transforms logs into formatted documentation, manages asset render blocks, and deploys presentation layouts directly onto integrated chat platforms[cite: 1].\n- **Core Skills:** Utilizes `canvas`, `video-frames`, and `gifgrep` to assemble structural multimedia items.\n\n## 🤝 Department 3: CSO (Automated Sales, Triage & Scheduling)\n- **Primary Agents & Frameworks:** `clawsweeper`, `taskflow-inbox-triage`, `channel-message-flows`, `tag-duplicate-prs-issues`[cite: 1].\n- **Operational Protocol:** Intercepts real-time webhook payloads, parses external system events, monitors customer communication flows, and flags duplicate incoming tracking events[cite: 1].\n- **Core Skills:** Deploys unified execution triggers natively through `wacli` (WhatsApp engine), `telegram-crabbox-e2e-proof`, `slack`, and `discord`.\n\n## 📊 Department 4: CFO & COO (Auditing, Infrastructure & Operations)\n- **Primary Agents & Frameworks:** `gitcrawl`, `notcrawl`, `graincrawl`, `discrawl`, `openclaw-landable-bug-sweep`, `security-triage`[cite: 1].\n- **Operational Protocol:** Indexes structural logs across multiple endpoints, parses compliance states, tracks external API usage through `model-usage`, and scans for security vulnerabilities using `openclaw-secret-scanning-maintainer` and `openclaw-ghsa-maintainer`[cite: 1].\n- **Core Skills:** Natively processes heavy multi-page documents using `nano-pdf` and `document-extract`, writing all audited mappings into SQLite[cite: 1].","timestamp":1780976879780,"idempotencyKey":"838e01c8-220b-4ca9-b7f6-8679f7441024:user"}}
