e2e-proof`, `slack`, and `discord`.\n\n## 📊 Department 4: CFO & COO (Auditing, Infrastructure & Operations)\n- **Primary Agents & Frameworks:** `gitcrawl`, `notcrawl`, `graincrawl`, `discrawl`, `openclaw-landable-bug-sweep`, `security-triage`.\n- **Operational Protocol:** Indexes structural logs across multiple endpoints, parses compliance states, tracks external API usage through `model-usage`, and scans for security vulnerabilities using `openclaw-secret-scanning-maintainer` and `openclaw-ghsa-maintainer`.\n- **Core Skills:** Natively processes heavy multi-page documents using `nano-pdf` and `document-extract`, writing all audited mappings into SQLite.","path":"/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":27960,"output":615,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28575,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780976891316}}
