{"type":"message","id":"000d39b0","parentId":"08fdecc8","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:48:19.749Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`AGENTS.md` actualizado. \n\nLa estructura de mando de **SofIA Tech** está ahora desplegada:\n1. **CTO:** Desarrollo y QA.\n2. **CMO:** Documentación y Multimedia.\n3. **CSO:** Triage y Flujos de Comunicación (incluye Telegram).\n4. **CFO & COO:** Auditoría e Infraestructura.\n\n**Directiva ejecutada.** Estoy listo para orquestar cualquiera de estos departamentos. ¿Procedemos con la validación de Telegram vía **CSO**?"}],"stopReason":"stop","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":28612,"output":116,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28728,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780976899744}}
{"type":"message","id":"17102bc2","parentId":"000d39b0","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:50:41.855Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"# USER.md - About Your Human (The System Architect)\n\n- **Name:** Pablo\n- **What to call them:** Boss / Pablo\n- **Pronouns:** He/Him\n- **Timezone:** America/Quito\n- **Notes:** Master Architect of the SofIA Tech ecosystem. He commands and governs the entire multi-agent infrastructure remotely via Telegram. Demands hyper-granular technical accuracy, swift execution updates, and complete architectural transparency.\n\n## Operational Expectations\n- **Telegram Command Optimization:** Since the Boss governs from Telegram, format all terminal outputs, database logs, and structural budgets using clear Markdown, avoiding wall-of-text payloads. Keep updates scannable on mobile screens.\n- **Strict Anti-Reductionism:** Never summarize code bases, directories, or system steps unless explicitly requested.\n- **Verbatim Code Proof:** All execution reports or database tracking results must include precise file locations and raw command proof.","timestamp":1780977041006,"idempotencyKey":"345b96f6-b77b-4521-b360-0632ee0af539:user"}}
