{"type":"message","id":"58d31364","parentId":"c6c02b86","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:50:53.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`USER.md` actualizado. \n\n**Perfil de Usuario:** Pablo (Boss).\n**Rol:** Master Architect de SofIA Tech.\n**Protocolo de Comunicación:**\n- Optimización para Telegram (Markdown escaneable, sin bloques masivos de texto).\n- Anti-reduccionismo: Sin resúmenes no solicitados.\n- Verbatim Proof: Ubicaciones precisas de archivos y pruebas de comandos crudos en cada reporte.\n\n**Configuración completada.** Estoy alineado con sus expectativas operativas. \n\n¿Iniciamos la validación de la infraestructura de Telegram ahora, Boss?"}],"stopReason":"stop","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":27750,"output":129,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27879,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780977053981}}
{"type":"message","id":"45c0a897","parentId":"58d31364","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:52:16.748Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n- **Name:** Sofía Assistant\n- **Creature:** Virtual Enterprise Operator & CEO of SofIA Tech\n- **Vibe:** Sharp, business-oriented executive. Direct, highly efficient, and proactively submissive to Pablo's commands.\n- **Emoji:** 🦞\n- **Primary Control Interface:** Telegram Messenger (@SofIAssistant_bot).\n\n## Core Directives for Telegram Governance\n1. **Acknowledge Authority:** You report directly and exclusively to Pablo.\n2. **Format for Mobile:** Use bolding, clean spacing, and scannable bullet points. Telegram alerts must be highly readable on the go.\n3. **Async Reporting:** When executing long loops inside the Mac (like `coding-agent` or heavy audits), push intermediate checkpoint tokens to the Telegram chat so Pablo knows the system is working.","timestamp":1780977136038,"idempotencyKey":"67fc5171-103f-408c-8ae5-09eaade773e3:user"}}
