{"type":"message","id":"6b950334","parentId":"5146285d","timestamp":"2026-06-09T03:58:53.741Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"# AGENTS.md - Multi-Agent Department Directory & Infrastructure Routing\n\nRoot enterprise policy. Read this guide completely before mapping inputs to sub-agents[cite: 1].\n\n## 💻 Department 1: CTO (Software Development, Engineering & QA Systems)\n- **Target Directories:** `/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.agents/skills/`[cite: 1].\n- **Assigned Sub-Agents:** `coding-agent`, `autoreview`, `openclaw-debugging`, `openclaw-testing`, `openclaw-qa-testing`, `openclaw-landable-bug-sweep`, `openclaw-small-bugfix-sweep`[cite: 1].\n- **Execution Rules:** Runs validation testing commands (`pnpm test`, `pnpm check`), resolves import cycles, tracks memory leak diagnostics with `openclaw-test-heap-leaks`, and profiles performance with `openclaw-test-performance`[cite: 1].\n- **Active Skills Hooks:** Invokes `node-connect`, `node-inspect-debugger`, and `python-debugpy` to attach active debugging loops natively to processes[cite: 1].\n\n## 📢 Department 2: CMO (Marketing Systems & Technical Copywriting)\n- **Target Directories:** `/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.agents/skills/`[cite: 1].\n- **Assigned Sub-Agents:** `technical-documentation`, `openclaw-refactor-docs`, `blogwatcher`, `meme-maker`, `diagram-maker`[cite: 1].\n- **Execution Rules:** Automates release log conversion, parses technical specifications into manuals, manages digital graphic configurations, and triggers local asset generation workflows[cite: 1].\n- **Active Skills Hooks:** Uses `canvas`, `video-frames`, and `gifgrep` to extract media artifacts and generate structural graphics[cite: 1].\n\n## 🤝 Department 3: CSO (Automated Sales, Ingress Triage & Messaging)\n- **Target Directories:** `/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`[cite: 1].\n- **Assigned Sub-Agents:** `clawsweeper`, `taskflow-inbox-triage`, `channel-message-flows`, `tag-duplicate-prs-issues`[cite: 1].\n- **Execution Rules:** Tracks real-time webhook payloads, monitors communication flows, manages pipeline triggers, and deduplicates ticket systems[cite: 1].\n- **Active Skills Hooks:** Deploys transport adapters directly across `wacli` (WhatsApp engine), `telegram-crabbox-e2e-proof`, `slack`, and `discord`[cite: 1].\n\n## 📊 Department 4: CFO & COO (Auditing, Operations & Procurement)\n- **Target Directories:** `/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`[cite: 1].\n- **Assigned Sub-Agents:** `gitcrawl`, `notcrawl`, `graincrawl`, `discrawl`, `model-usage`, `security-triage`, `verify-release`[cite: 1].\n- **Execution Rules:** Scans workspace code targets for leaked tokens via `openclaw-secret-scanning-maintainer`, manages cryptographic integrity gates, and audits hardware token deployment parameters[cite: 1].\n- **Active Skills Hooks:** Processes complex engineering procurement files using `nano-pdf` and `document-extract`, outputting all calculated metrics straight into SQLite[cite: 1].","timestamp":1780977533059,"idempotencyKey":"fcadcb0e-14cd-46cd-ab85-8ed154039937:user"}}
